---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'; import { studio } from '../data/studio';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Suzannah Pugh Music Studio"><Header /><main id="main"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>A starter privacy notice.</h1><p class="placeholder">[OWNER REVIEW REQUIRED: This starter template is not legal advice and must be reviewed before launch.]</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell prose narrow"><h2>Information collected</h2><p>The lesson inquiry form may collect a parent or student name, email address, optional phone number, student age, instrument interest, experience level, general availability, and voluntary goals or comments.</p><h2>Why it is collected</h2><p>This information is used to respond to lesson inquiries and determine whether an introductory conversation may be appropriate. Please do not submit sensitive student records, medical information, or school records.</p><h2>How information is delivered</h2><p>When connected, the form sends information through the studio’s selected form provider. A scheduling provider may process information if the optional introductory-conversation scheduling feature is enabled.</p><h2>Sharing and deletion</h2><p>The studio does not sell inquiry information. Third-party form or scheduling providers may process submitted data according to their own policies. To request deletion of an inquiry, contact {studio.contactEmail}.</p><p class="placeholder">[CONFIRM: Form provider, retention period, and reviewed privacy language.]</p></div></section></main><Footer /></BaseLayout>
